      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18344/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush potato slices on both sides with butter; place them onto the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tpGck9FZ_2L1AMrT4SO_iMuzQRc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18344-Cheese-and-Bacon-Potato-Rounds-DDMFS-4x3-step-2-62-70df413f15a94975a6d01a76c3b6f45c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18344/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until lightly browned and tender when pierced with a knife, 30 to 40 minutes, flipping slices halfway through. Sprinkle with Cheddar, crumbled bacon, and green onions. Continue baking until cheese melts, 3 to 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
